  "description": "A dirt-poor protagonist, born into a family so impoverished that he has none of the things people envy for such as good looks, a charming personality, or a brilliant mind. Unable to achieve success in real life, he lived vicariously through the mobile game \\[Age of Success\\]. Then, one day, a game-like status window suddenly appeared before him in midair. \\[Launching Age of Success\\] \\[Work hard, grow, and seize success\\]\n\n(Source: TOPTOON, translated)",
